# 3 — Installation & Integrity

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  Artifact[Verified Artifact] --> Host[Host Discovery]
  Host --> Plan[Installation Plan]
  Plan --> Authorization[Authorization]
  Authorization --> Install[Installation]
  Install --> Hash[SHA-256 Verification]
  Hash --> Record[Installation Evidence]
```

Record host identity as appropriate, architecture, installation target, permissions, services/timers selected, configuration changes, artifact hash, installed-file manifest, and verification result.

An integrity match establishes equality with the trusted reference. It does not independently establish the legality, morality, or provenance of the reference.
